{"id":"qq90a9nn5bu4nitj8zp5tqq36","title":"科学伦理委员会不应是个摆设","originalTitle":null,"summary":"中国近年来多次出台科研诚信建设政策，要求科技部和社科院牵头负责，并对严重失信行为实行联合惩戒。然而，高校学术不端事件频发，科学伦理委员会的作用未充分发挥。科学伦理委员会应由学风正派、坚持原则的老师组成，切实履行监督职责。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=729911&do=blog&id=1561870"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T03:58:59.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.657Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.657Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"bd20f507-7cbd-4370-8fe2-94b1c61077cf","title":"中国科研诚信政策执行遇挑战"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"bd20f507-7cbd-4370-8fe2-94b1c61077cf","title":"中国科研诚信政策执行遇挑战"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fqzMW2wiy_rg","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}